WEBVTT

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.790
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.390
The Bagra Army's assassin, Baalmon,

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:16.130
was reincarnated as a new 
Warrior, Beelzebumon.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:19.480
And he finally joined our Xros Heart team!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.830
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.830
<b>Enemy?                          The battle begins!                      Enemy</b>

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.830
<b>Team ?       Team Kiriha                             Team Taiki</b>

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.830
Mysterious                        Rival
Girl

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.830
<b>Enemy?
Ally?</b>

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.830
Protagonist

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:29.860
<b>Heaven Zone, A Trap in Paradise!</b>

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.460
Heaven Zone, A Trap in Paradise!

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.100
Defendant, Puttomon.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.030
The defendant will now be executed.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.030
Crime must be punished!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.330
Crime must be punished!

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:01.030
Ow, ow, ow...

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:03.650
Where are we?

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:04.320
I don't know.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.060
What is this place? It looks like paradise.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.610
Look, it's art!

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:17.000
Art is a blast!

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.730
Where?

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.110
U-Um...

00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:25.360
It's art! Art, art, art!

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.900
You don't even know what art is, do you?

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:31.210
What a nice place. It's so pretty.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.090
Yeah, it looks peaceful.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:34.320
But is it really?

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:40.170
Beelzebumon! Where were you?

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:42.480
I'm always close to you.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.420
I'll go look around.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:51.240
There he goes...

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:55.730
I see. He can travel freely 
around the Digital realm.

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.020
He said he was going to look around,

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:02.500
but it doesn't look like the 
Bagra Army has been here yet...

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.410
Taiki!

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.320
Thanks!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.220
Who are you?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.090
Shakkoumon.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:27.390
This paradise is not just a paradise.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.730
Wh-What was that?

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:36.530
I don't get it...

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:38.540
It's art!

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:41.720
Is everything you don't 
understand "art" to you?!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.830
Is this...

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:46.260
...above the clouds?

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:49.510
Maybe that's why the Bagra 
Army hasn't been here yet.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:52.350
I guess we could take 
it easy once in a while.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.860
I agree!

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:57.460
Yay!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.580
It's like a vacation!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:01.540
Grunt, grunt, grunt...

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:07.000
Cool!

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:07.800
I think I'll join in!

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:23.920
Stepping on the grass is forbidden!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.750
Huh?

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.920
Making a racket is forbidden!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.080
Racket?

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.890
But taiko is my soul!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.220
I'm taking you into police custody!

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.390
What'd you say?!

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.230
How dare you! Bit Bomb!

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:49.070
I've got buddies, too!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.260
Guys! Help me!

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.640
Leave this to us!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.600
Wish Upon a Star!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.560
Sugar Plum!

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.360
Stop it, you guys!

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.200
Arrest them all!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.380
Arrest them!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.660
Stop!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.960
They came from a different Zone.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.230
Let them go.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.970
Do we have an incident?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.900
It is an incident!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.610
Where's the suspect?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:21.710
Sergeant Gargoylemon!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.010
Lucemon is defending the criminals again!

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:26.550
Is that so?

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:27.910
Then, Lucemon...

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.520
You will take their punishment.

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:34.850
White Statue!

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.630
What do you think you're doing?!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.170
If you keep trying to help everyone,

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.800
you will soon be executed, Lucemon!

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.440
Are you okay?

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:53.040
Yeah.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.090
I'm sorry, Lucemon.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.480
It's all right. I'm just glad 
you all weren't punished.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.750
But taiko is not a racket!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.650
We know, we know.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.950
This place has really strict rules, huh?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:05.930
Yes.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.840
We have excellent defenses, 
thanks to a strong police force,

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:12.820
that protect us from the 
reign of the Bagra Army.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:15.150
So that's why the Bagra Army isn't here.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:17.830
Even without the Bagra Army, 
they're still pretty strict.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:18.870
I'll say!

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.500
I don't want to stay in a place 
where they call taiko a "racket!"

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:25.150
But it's a peaceful place as long as 
everyone follows the rules, right?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:29.570
Yes. All the Digimon here love fine art.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.690
We have magnificent painters and sculptors.

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:33.840
It's a treasure trove of beauty.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.110
I want to see fine art!

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.370
Then let's go have a look.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.950
You're going to see it?!

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:43.250
It'll be easy to get the Code Crown 
if the Bagra Army isn't here.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.180
You're collecting Code Crowns?

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:46.930
Yeah.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:50.800
We've got Code Crowns from five Zones!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:51.700
I see...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.730
But this Zone's Code Crown 
is protected by a seal.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.140
A seal?

00:05:57.140 --> 00:06:01.640
Yes. It can only be broken 
using a special method.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.480
A seal, huh?

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:08.850
But we don't need to steal 
it if this place is at peace.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:12.820
We only want peace for the Digital World.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.250
Yeah!

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.800
You are all wonderful!

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.790
I feel the same.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.390
There's a presidential election coming up,

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:24.200
and I've announced my candidacy.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.700
So this place has a president...

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.830
The current president of this Zone

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.640
<b>Justice</b>

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.640
<b>Order</b>

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:33.420
is the chief of the angel 
police force, SlashAngemon.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.710
<b>Justice</b>

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.710
<b>Order</b>

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.710
<b>Slash
Angemon</b>

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.710
<b>A Peaceful Future</b>

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.710
<b>Lucemon</b>

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.710
How does the election process work?

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:38.030
This is the symbol of the candidates.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.640
When a candidate gathers 
everyone's support,

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.580
his heart glows red.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:46.510
I want to win the election and 
change the strict rules here.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.760
You're pretty respectable for a young guy!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.470
You've got our support!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.620
Thank you.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:55.490
Please allow me to show you around.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.600
It's like the town itself is a work of art!

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:07.890
There are so many kinds of 
places in the Digital World.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:10.910
I've never seen a place like this!

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.780
It's the Digimon from before!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.770
Thanks for your help!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:16.660
Did something happen?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.550
He saved me when I fell off the edge.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:21.310
Really?

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:24.090
But you should be careful 
around Shakkoumon.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.390
There are rumors that he's 
a spy for the police.

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.720
What?!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.860
Now that you mention it...

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:32.130
His eyes do look kind of evil.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.720
That's the outdoor art museum.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.970
Lots of priceless works of 
art are on exhibit here.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.060
Please take your time looking around.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:52.380
Beauti... Beauti...

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.520
Beautiful!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:58.130
Yeah, well, taiko is art, too!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.240
Hey, it's gone!

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.860
I bet it's over there!

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:07.670
You actually understand this thing, Taiki?

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:11.340
Nope, not a clue!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.100
I thought so...

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.160
Dondokomon...

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:22.910
Did you break this?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:24.890
I didn't! I swear!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:27.550
It just fell over!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:31.960
Oh, it's you again, eh?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.260
This priceless work of art is...

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:40.970
This angel statue is the 
symbol of the Heaven Zone!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:44.940
What's this?

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:50.340
I... I dropped that.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.280
What?!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.080
You are the criminal!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.660
It wasn't me!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.990
Liar! This is the proof!

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:04.720
You whacked the angel statue with those 
dangerous weapons, and broke it!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.390
I didn't do it!

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:08.970
Save your excuses for the station!

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:11.780
Dondokomon said he didn't do it!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:12.930
There's been some mistake!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.480
If you insist on interfering...

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:16.470
You're all under arrest as well!

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:18.620
Holy Shot!

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:22.210
Take them away!

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.680
Hey! Let me go!

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.810
Taiki!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.500
They've been arrested!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.380
What do we do?!

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.680
This is bad! Very bad!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.220
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.650
They may be made up of data,

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:55.570
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.640
Join us in our world of adventure

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:01.210
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:02.280
DigiXros!

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.300
Give Taiki and our friends back!

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:30.440
I can't do that.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.540
They are being interrogated.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:33.710
Interrogated?

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.550
What's going to happen to them?

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:40.170
They will undoubtedly be 
given a harsh sentence.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.850
'Fess up!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.200
I didn't break the angel statue!

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.830
Dondokomon doesn't lie.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.020
Go investigate the scene again!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.910
You're a human, are you not?

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:55.190
Why did you come to the Digital World?

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.110
I just... before I knew it...

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:00.670
Before you knew it, 
you'd done something bad?

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.330
All criminals say that.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.690
I told you, we're not criminals!

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:07.870
Is that so?

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.160
Here. You must be hungry.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.860
Have some DigiNoir-don.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.010
Don't mind if I do!

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.250
Guess they don't have katsudon...

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:25.510
You have friends and a 
hometown, too, don't you?

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.170
They must be crying...

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.310
Don't you get it?!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.000
If you'd just confess your crime,

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.430
your sentence will be lighter!

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.410
What would our sentence be?

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.100
If you don't confess...

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:40.840
Death!

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.240
Death?!

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:45.770
If you do confess, 
you'll be publicly electrocuted

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.260
and your data will be revoked.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.860
Same for the other two.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.450
Both of those are awful...

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:55.110
I'll give you some time. 
Just think it over.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.530
But...

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.290
I really didn't do it...

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.760
What do we do, Taiki?

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:10.550
I got it.

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.710
We'll find the real criminal.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:13.170
Huh?!

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:17.080
We'll find proof that 
Dondokomon didn't do it.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.210
Taiki! You believe me?

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:21.850
Of course I do!

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:29.950
Here you are!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.330
We came to rescue you.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.590
Let's get out of here quick!

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:39.450
You won't escape!

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:45.070
Are you trying to add more 
to your list of crimes?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.260
We're going to find the real criminal!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:48.640
So—

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.080
I won't listen to the 
ravings of a criminal!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.280
Get them!

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.530
Holy Shot!

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.420
Shooting Star!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.900
Rock Damashi!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.710
Heavy Speaker!

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.780
White—

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.550
Holy Espada!

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:17.740
What are you doing?

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:18.840
President!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:19.990
Who are they?

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.870
Sir! These outsiders committed a crime

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:24.040
and then escaped confinement!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.180
What?

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:29.990
All those who resist the absolute 
authority of this Zone's police force,

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:32.480
no matter who they are,

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.890
will be executed!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.510
One of you intruders from a foreign Zone

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:43.680
destroyed the angel statue 
that symbolizes our Zone,

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:46.150
and resisted arrest along 
with your companions

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.270
when police attempted to 
take you into custody.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.640
Then, during your interrogation,

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.270
you made the foolish decision to escape.

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.010
You will now be publicly 
executed for these crimes.

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:58.040
You can't be serious!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.180
We resisted because you tried

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:01.980
to punish our friend

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.620
without any evidence!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:03.610
Silence!

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:07.490
Talking back to my police 
force is also a crime.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.900
The defendants will be executed so that

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.490
they can never commit such crimes again.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:15.990
Crime must be punished!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:17.260
Crime must be punished!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:26.540
Crime must be punished! 
Crime must be punished!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.770
Wait!

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:29.140
Declaring them guilty and punishing them

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.040
without any definitive evidence is wrong!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:36.250
Shouldn't we look into who 
really did this, like they said?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.220
Lucemon!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:40.690
You will pay for criticizing 
my police force!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.460
You will also be executed by—

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.660
Stop!

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:46.730
I'm sorry.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.990
I'm the one who broke the angel statue.

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.590
I was playing hide and seek,

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.620
and I accidentally bumped into it.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.900
I'm sorry for not saying anything!

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.560
So you're the real criminal, eh?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.410
I knew the real criminal was 
still out there all along.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:06.410
What a liar!

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:15.750
Crime must be punished!

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.020
Crime must be punished!

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:22.310
Crime must be punished! 
Crime must be punished!

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:22.310
Stop!

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:25.350
No matter how priceless that statue was,

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:28.050
taking a life in compensation 
for it is wrong!

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.180
Don't interfere.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:32.870
You live in such a 
beautiful, peaceful world,

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:35.320
so can't you let everyone 
enjoy their lives here?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.840
Don't you all agree?

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.540
He's right!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.380
This world is wrong!

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:44.380
Punishing people severely for 
breaking the smallest rule,

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.200
controlling citizens through fear...

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.490
Let's change this world with our own hands!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.540
Lucemon is right!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.890
I hate living in this world!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.430
Lucemon should be our next president!

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:56.090
That's right!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.330
Lucemon! Change our world!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.200
Lucemon for president!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.340
Silence!

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:04.540
You outsiders have 
overstepped your bounds!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.970
I'll execute you all!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.240
Here we go, guys!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.520
Shoutmon!

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.110
Oh yeah!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:13.410
Ballistamon!

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.050
Dorulumon!

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:18.480
Starmons!

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:19.660
Yes!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.090
DigiXros!

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:23.700
DigiXros!

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.680
Shoutmon X4!

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:41.740
No one can defeat Sir SlashAngemon!

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:44.240
Think you can withstand my blades?!

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:51.180
He's fast!

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.760
He's too fast! X4 can't keep up!

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.830
What a wretched sight.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.600
Take some of this!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:09.120
Holy Espada!

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.660
Burning Star Crusher!

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.930
I will throw you down from the heavens!

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.140
Taiki, let me DigiXros!

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:50.010
Beelzebumon!

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:52.860
I don't like people who tie 
others down with power.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:56.010
If you Xros me, we can match his speed.

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:57.240
Okay!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.180
Who are you?!

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.150
Shoutmon X4!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:02.750
Okay!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.560
Beelzebumon!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.630
DigiXros!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.230
DigiXros!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:22.890
Shoutmon X4B!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.010
What?!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:31.330
Holy Espada!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.500
He moves much faster now!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.940
Now we're an even match!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.370
Where'd he go?

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.260
Behind you!

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:08.940
That's enough!

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:16.930
S-Sir SlashAngemon lost!

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.630
President, won't you let Cupimon go?

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:22.870
Release him.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.560
Thank you!

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.340
I'm grateful to you, too.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.250
Thank you.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.910
Your brave actions were amazing, too.

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.550
Way to go, Lucemon!

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.480
Lucemon will be our next president!

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:39.530
Lucemon for President!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.900
President Lucemon!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:51.270
Lucemon! Lucemon! Lucemon!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

