00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Atomic Bomber
Supernova</b>

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:14.490
Boom, bang, boom!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:17.690
Just when we thought all was at peace,

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:21.690
all the Digimon are suffering and 
the ground has split in two!

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:23.960
Nene has appeared with a black Digimon.

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:24.760
What is that thing?

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:26.930
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.730
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>The Black Knight Digimon Appears!</b>
